gationContext":null,"metadataText":null,"text":{"textDirection":"FIRST_STRONG","text":"I’m excited to share that I’ll be joining Canva Research as a Senior Research Engineer focused on multimodal agent evaluations!\n\nMy time at Snowflake taught me invaluable lessons about building reliable AI agents. Watching these systems evolve from experimental tools to production-critical infrastructure across coding and data science agents, MCP servers, and skills showed me how essential robust evaluation and observability are at scale.\n\nAt Canva, I'll be exploring the frontier of multimodal agent evaluation: research and applied engineering to assess AI systems that generate and reason across text, vision, audio, design, and beyond! \uD83C\uDF0E I'm excited to translate cutting-edge evaluation methods into resilient, trustworthy agents that help make design more accessible for all!\n\nHuge thanks to my colleagues at Snowflake for the collaboration, learning, and growth. And I can't wait to dive in with the team at Canva!\n\nIf you're working on agent evals, multimodal systems, or AI safety and alignment, let's connect! There's so much we can learn from each other. \uD83D\uDE80\n\n#MultimodalEvals #AgentEvals #CanvaLife #ImJoiningCanva","attributesV2":[{"start":42,"length":5,"detailData":{"jobPostingName":null,"hyperlink":null,"profileFamiliarName":null,"color":null,"icon":null,"epoch":null,"systemImage":null,"*companyName":"urn:li:fsd_company:2850862","textLink":null,"listItemStyle":null,"groupName":null,"hyperlinkOpenExternally":null,"listStyle":null,"profileFullName":null,"stringFieldReference":null,"learningCourseName":null,"profileMention":null,"style":null,"schoolName":null,"hashtag":null},"$recipeTypes":["com.linkedin.96aa16bd79ad1560bbd3a002bc9b3fad"],"$type":"com.linkedin.voyager.dash.common.text.TextAttribute"},{"start":42,"length":5,"detailData":{"jobPostingName":null,"hyperlink":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/canva/","profileFamiliarName":null,"color":null,"co