ll,"groupMembershipForJoinAction":null,"showSmallActorPortrait":false},"boostHeader":null,"*socialDetail":"urn:li:fsd_socialDetail:(urn:li:activity:7427467246773575680,urn:li:activity:7427467246773575680,urn:li:highlightedReply:-)","header":null,"preDashEntityUrn":"urn:li:fs_updateV2:(urn:li:activity:7427467246773575680,MAIN_FEED,DEBUG_REASON,DEFAULT,false)","commentary":{"numLines":3,"translation":null,"navigationContext":null,"metadataText":null,"text":{"textDirection":"FIRST_STRONG","text":"Four years at Canva \uD83C\uDF86\uD83C\uDF86\uD83C\uDF86\n\nAnd I can’t help but think about the 22 year old version of me who first stepped into a classroom.\n\nShe was excited. Nervous. Determined. Completely unaware of how much that experience would shape her.\n\nTeaching was my foundation.\n\nIt taught me how to communicate clearly.\nHow to manage complexity.\nHow to build trust.\nHow to lead a room.\nHow to support people through frustration and breakthrough moments.\n\nAnd now, four years into my role at Canva, I see how deeply that foundation still carries me.\n\nWhat started as stepping out of the classroom has turned into:\n\n✨ Supporting educators and teams across the globe\n✨ Collaborating with some of the most brilliant minds in tech\n✨ Learning how to operate within a truly global organization\n✨ Growing into a leader who thinks beyond one room and into entire systems\n\nWorking across time zones, cultures, and functions has stretched me in ways I never imagined. I’ve learned how to align diverse teams. How to influence without authority. How to think strategically while still staying grounded in people.\n\nAnd the joy? It’s still the same.\n\nIt’s the joy of empowering someone to create.\nThe joy of seeing confidence build.\nThe joy of knowing your work helps someone do theirs better.\n\nI am so proud of that 22 year old who chose the classroom.\n\nIt took her almost a decade to believe she could do more. But she never stopped building the skills that would make “more” possible.\n\nI would not be here without my students. Without the schools that trusted me. Without the messy, beautiful, exhausting years of teaching.\n\nThey built me.\n\nAnd I wouldn’t be able to do what I do today without my incredible teammates at Canva, who challenge, support, and inspire me every single day.\n\nFour years at Canva.\nAnd still just getting started.\n\nGrateful. Proud. And excited for what’s next. \uD83D\uDC9B\n\n#FormerTeacher #TransitionedEducator #Canva #CanvaLife #EdXit","attributesV2":[{"start":1767,"length":5,"detailData":{"jobPostingName":null,"hyperlink":null,"profileFamiliarName":null,"color":null,"icon":null,"epoch":null,"systemImage":null,"*companyName":"urn:li:fsd_company:2850862","textLink":null,"listItemStyle":null,"groupName":null,"hyperlinkOpenExternally":null,"listStyle":null,"profileFullName":null,"stringFieldReference":null,"learningCourseName":null,"profileMention":null,"style":null,"schoolName":null,"hashtag":null},"$recipeTypes":["com.linkedin.96aa16bd79ad1560bbd3a002bc9b3fad"],"$type":"com.linkedin.voyager.dash.common.text.TextAttribute"},{"start":1767,"length":5,"detailData":{"jobPostingName":null,"hyperlink":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/canva/","profileFamiliarName":null,"color":null,"companyName":null,"icon":null,"epoch":null,"systemImage":null,"textLink":null,"listItemStyle":null,"groupName":null,"hyperlinkOpenExternally":null,"listStyle":null,"profileFullName":null,"stringFieldReference":null,"learningCourseName":null,"profileMention":null,"style":null,"schoolName":null,"hashtag":null},"$recipeTypes":["com.linkedin.96aa16bd79ad1560bbd3a002bc9b3fad"],"$type":"com.linkedin.voyager.dash.common.text.TextAttribute"},{"start":1856,"length":14,"detailData":{"jobPostingName":null,"hyperlink":null,"profileFamiliarName":null,"color":null,"companyName":null,"*hashtag":"urn:li:fsd_hashtag:(formerteacher,urn:li:activity:7427467246773575680)","icon":null,"epoch":null,"systemImage":null,"textLink":null,"listItemStyle":nu