REMIUM_OFFLINE","entityUrn":"urn:li:fsd_jobPosting:4366245388","*location":"urn:li:fsd_geo:103392068","*workplaceTypesResolutionResults":["urn:li:fsd_workplaceType:1"]},{"companyDetails":{"$recipeTypes":["com.linkedin.7397df9daf3daee6b2674bb755e1e2ed"],"jobCompany":{"rawCompanyName":null,"*company":"urn:li:fsd_company:6473075"},"$type":"com.linkedin.voyager.dash.jobs.JobPostingCompany"},"trackingUrn":"urn:li:jobPosting:4372576924","jobState":"LISTED","*jobWorkplaceTypes":["urn:li:fsd_workplaceType:3"],"description":{"textDirection":"USER_LOCALE","text":"Valiant Finance is an award-winning FinTech startup on a mission to simplify business lending. Our cloud-based platform helps thousands of Australian small businesses compare and apply for loans from over 80 of the country's leading lenders. Our platform doesn't just power our own services – it also drives the commercial lending capabilities for some of the world’s most recognised brands.\nOur global Enterprise technology arm provides embedded finance experience and orchestration infrastructure to enterprise clients. We pride ourselves on building and delivering category-leading tech products across the US, Australia and the UK for top-tier global businesses. We have a strong growth agenda and are always looking for top talent to join the pursuit of our vision to “unleash the economic potential of every idea”!\nWe're a fast-growing company, and we're looking for an experienced Senior Ruby on Rails Backend Engineer to join our team on a full-time basis. Our engineering team is remote-friendly but we work from our Surry Hills office 2-3 times a week to collaborate. We’re looking for a candidate who is passionate about engineering and technology, can solve technical problems and is able to communicate problems and solutions with ease.\n\nWhat You'll Be DoingAs a Senior Backend Engineer, you'll be instrumental in shaping the future of our platform. Your responsibilities will include:Designing and building RESTful APIs for our front-end applications and partnersIntegrating with a range of external services such as Salesforce, Auth0, Cloudflare, and moreArchitecting solutions that meet our high availability, security, and performance requirementsMaintaining our infrastructure on a major cloud provider to support our rapid growthWriting well-structured, tested, and documented code that's a pleasure to maintainWorking closely with our Product, Design, and other teams to refine deliverables and bring new features to life\n\nWhat We're Looking ForWe're seeking a passionate backend engineer who can solve complex technical problems and communicate solutions with ease.Required Experience:Minimum 5 years of commercial Ruby on Rails experienceProven experience integrating with multiple external APIsExperience with database design and performance tuning, particularly with PostgreSQLExperience designing and maintaining infrastructure with AWS, GCP, or HerokuExperience with testing frameworks like RspecExperience with high-volume background job processing frameworks like SidekiqStrong experience designing and maintaining both public and private REST APIsProficiency with development tools like Linear or JiraStrong written and verbal communication skillsBonus Points:Experience with security best practices (e.g., OWASP, STRIDE)Experience with synchronising data between distributed systemsExperience in high-volume production environments with strict availability SLAsKnowledge of the financial services industry (lending or corporate finance)A Computer Science degreeExperience navigating GDPR and/or SOC2\n\nBenefits & CultureWe're a remote-friendly team, but if you prefer an office environment, our Surry Hills space is open, dog-friendly, and empowering. We foster a culture where innovation is recognised and rewarded.Embrace your need for work-life balance with our hybrid working modelCelebrate the joy of starting a family with 8 weeks of paid parental leaveBring your furry friend to hang out in our brand new, dog-friendly officeCompany-wide events designed to honour and celebrate all the outstanding achievements of our amazing teamMost importantly, we're looking for someone who is ready to embody our core values:\"Get S#!t Done\"Thrive in the PrideBe customer champions\nPlease apply via the link below or submit your resume to jobs@valiant.finance","attributesV2":[{"start":0,"length":391,"detailData":{"jobPostingName":null,"hyperlink":null,"profileFamiliarName":null,"color":null,"companyName":null,"icon":null,"epoch":null,"systemImage":null,"textLink":null,"listItemStyle":null,"groupName":null,"hyperlinkOpenExternally":null,"listStyle":null,"profileFullName":null,"stringFieldReference":null,"learningCourseName":null,"profileMention":null,"style":"PARAGRAPH","schoolName":null,"hashtag":null},"$recipeTypes":["com.linkedin.a86ec3a7ab50c2c801e0395a86ff19c0"],"$type":"com.linkedin.voyager.dash.common.text.TextAttribute"},{"start":391,"length":1,"detailData":{"jobPostingName":null,"hyperlink":null,"profileFamiliarName":null,"color":null,"companyName":null,"icon":null,"epoch":null,"systemImage":null,"textLink":null,"listItemStyle":null,"groupName":null,"hyperlinkOpenExternally":null,"listStyle":null,"profileFullName":null,"stringFieldReference":null,"learningCourseName":null,"profileMention":null,"style":"PARAGRAPH","schoolName":null,"hashtag":null},"$recipeTypes":["com.linkedin.a86ec3a7ab50c2c801e0395a86ff19c0"],"$type":"com.linkedin.voyager.dash.common.text.TextAttribute"},{"start":392,"length":428,"detailData":{"jobPostingName":null,"hyperlink":null,"profileFamiliarName":null,"color":null,"companyName":null,"icon":null,"epoch":null,"systemImage":null,"textLink":null,"listItemStyle":null,"groupName":null,"hyperlinkOpenExternally":null,"listStyle":null,"profileFullName":null,"stringFieldReference":null,"learningCourseName":null,"profileMention":null,"style":"PARAGRAPH","schoolName":null,"hashtag":null},"$recipeTypes":["com.linkedin.a86ec3a7ab50c2c801e0395a86ff19c0"],"